      <h2 id="contact-heading" class="section-title mb-4 animate-on-scroll">Let's Connect</h2>
      <p class="text-surface-400 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">Open to discussing software architecture, modern C++, engineering excellence, or collaboration opportunities.</p>
